>   I think, I found a bug in the latest LaTeX2e release in the
>   definition of \@idxitem.
 
>   In article.cls, report.cls, book.cls \@idxitem is defined like this:
>           \newcommand\@idxitem{\hangindent 40\p@}
>
>   In the previous latex release it was defined like this:
>
>           \newcommand\@idxitem{\par\hangindent 40\p@}
>                                ^^^^^
>
>
>   Is this bugfix ok?
>
>
 
